course: dictionary
lesson: 9928
title: Tantrum: a sudden burst of anger
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A tantrum is a sudden burst of anger or upset, with crying, shouting or kicking. It often happens to a young child who cannot get what they want.
explain: Read the words around it. «Tired» said about a child often means cranky, or having a tantrum, which is a fit of screaming and crying. The clues tell you a tantrum is a big, loud outburst.
explain: Older people can throw a tantrum too, when they act in a very childish, angry way. «A tantrum with a keyboard» means an angry online rant, so the word can also be used in new ways.
fact: A tantrum is a sudden burst of anger or upset.
fact: «Have a tantrum», «throw a tantrum» and «temper tantrum» are common phrases.
fact: «Having a moment» said about a child means throwing a tantrum.
fact: «A tantrum with a keyboard» means an angry online rant.
fact: Calm adults, naming feelings and taking deep breaths can help a child who is having a tantrum.
exercise: «Tired» said about a child often means cranky, or having a tantrum. What is a tantrum? | A type of sweet | A long walk in the rain | A quiet, sleepy nap | *A sudden burst of anger or upset, with crying or shouting
exercise: Ben says, «He is having a moment» about his little brother, who is screaming on the floor. What does Ben mean? | His brother is reading quietly | His brother is asleep | His brother has won a prize | *His brother is throwing a tantrum
exercise: «The toddler threw a tantrum when his juice spilled.» Find and copy one word that means a sudden burst of anger. | juice | spilled | toddler | *tantrum
test: Which phrase means having a sudden fit of anger? | Go for a swim | Sleep in | *Throw a tantrum | Read aloud
test: Older people can throw a tantrum too. What does that tell you? | Only toddlers ever get angry | Tantrums only happen at school | Tantrums are always good for you | *Older people can act in a very childish, angry way
exam: «A tantrum with a keyboard» is used online. What does it mean? | A tidy desk | A happy video game | *An angry online rant | A computer that needs fixing
